{"c":"感","pinyin":"gǎn","lectures":["gǎn"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["戊","一","口","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0176","L2-0177","L2-0178","L2-0179","L3-0220","L3-0221","L3-0222","L3-0565","L4-0263","L5-0261","L5-0506","L6-0302","L6-0554","L7-0915","L7-1053","L7-1257","L7-1258","L7-1259","L7-1260","L7-1261","L7-1262","L7-1263","L7-1264","L7-1265","L7-1455","L7-1589","L7-2425","L7-2653","L7-3556","L7-4130","L7-5111"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sentiment ; ressentir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"sentiment, sensation"},{"categorie":"Suffix","fr":"suffixe : sens de (la responsabilité…)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我对他很有好感。","pinyin":"Wǒ duì tā hěn yǒu hǎogǎn.","fr":"Il m'est très sympathique.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"敢":{"c":"敢","pinyin":"gǎn","lectures":["gǎn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":null,"mots":["L3-0219","L4-0890","L5-0060","L6-0301","L7-1256","L7-2226"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"oser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"oser, avoir le courage de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我不敢一个人走夜路。","pinyin":"Wǒ bù gǎn yī ge rén zǒu yèlù.","fr":"Je n'ose pas marcher seul la nuit.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"赶":{"c":"赶","pinyin":"gǎn","lectures":["gǎn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","龰","干"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L3-0215","L3-0216","L3-0217","L3-0218","L6-0298","L6-0299","L6-0300","L7-1254","L7-1255","L7-5517"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"se dépêcher ; rattraper ; chasser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"se dépêcher, se hâter (pour ne pas manquer)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"rattraper"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"chasser, faire partir"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我要赶火车。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào gǎn huǒchē.","fr":"Je dois me dépêcher pour attraper le train.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"干":{"c":"干","pinyin":"gàn","lectures":["gàn","gān"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0111","L1-0112","L1-0113","L1-0114","L2-0175","L2-0180","L3-0223","L4-0540","L5-0043","L5-0258","L5-0259","L5-0260","L6-0295","L7-1248","L7-1249","L7-1250","L7-1266","L7-1267","L7-1417","L7-1659","L7-3504","L7-3890","L7-4921"],"chemin":{"hsk":30,"lire":33},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire, travailler, sec","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"衣服干了。","pinyin":"Yīfu gān le.","fr":"Le linge est sec.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"这个工作谁来干？","pinyin":"Zhège gōngzuò shéi lái gàn?","fr":"Qui va faire ce travail ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les bronzes, 干 dessine un objet de combat, une perche fourchue en haut, que l'on lit comme une arme à fourche ou comme un bouclier. Le sens ancien survit dans 干戈, le bouclier et la hache-poignard, c'est-à-dire la guerre. La simplification a aussi confié à 干 les caractères 乾, « sec », et 幹, « tronc, faire », d'où ses lectures gān et gàn.","en":"On bronzes, 干 draws a fighting implement, a pole forked at the top, read either as a forked weapon or as a shield. The old meaning survives in 干戈, shield and dagger-axe, that is, war. Simplification also gave 干 the work of 乾, “dry”, and 幹, “trunk, to do”, hence its readings gān and gàn.","roles":{}}},"冈":{"c":"冈","pinyin":"gāng","lectures":["gāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["冂","乂"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-3541"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"colline, crête","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"colline, crête"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"刚":{"c":"刚","pinyin":"gāng","lectures":["gāng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["冂","乂","刂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0181","L2-0182","L2-0183","L6-0303","L7-1268"],"chemin":{"lire":182},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"à l'instant, tout juste","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他刚走。","pinyin":"Tā gāng zǒu.","fr":"Il vient de partir.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi range 刚 parmi les idéo-phonétiques et le glose par « fort, qui tranche net ». 刂, le couteau, donne le sens, et 冈, la crête de colline, formé ici de 冂 et de 乂, donne le son. 冈 se lit gāng comme 刚, et le sens adverbial « tout juste, à l'instant » est venu plus tard.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi classes 刚 as a phonetic compound and glosses it as “strong, cutting clean”. 刂, the knife, gives the meaning, and 冈, a ridge, built here from 冂 and 乂, gives the sound. 冈 reads gāng just like 刚, and the adverbial sense “just, a moment ago” came later.","roles":{"冂":"son","乂":"son","刂":"sens"}}},"纲":{"c":"纲","pinyin":"gāng","lectures":["gāng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","冂","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L5-0161","L7-1269","L7-1270"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"grandes lignes, principe directeur","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"grandes lignes, principe directeur"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"老师给了我们一份学习纲要。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī gěi le wǒmen yī fèn xuéxí gāngyào.","fr":"Le professeur nous a donné un plan d'étude.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"缸":{"c":"缸","pinyin":"gāng","lectures":["gāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["缶","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1272"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"jarre, bassin","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"jarre, bassin, aquarium"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"院子里有一口大水缸。","pinyin":"Yuànzi li yǒu yī kǒu dà shuǐgāng.","fr":"Il y a une grande réserve d'eau dans la cour.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"钢":{"c":"钢","pinyin":"gāng","lectures":["gāng","gàng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["钅","冂","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L5-0262","L5-0263","L7-1271"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"acier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"acier"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这座桥是用钢做的。","pinyin":"Zhè zuò qiáo shì yòng gāng zuò de.","fr":"Ce pont est en acier.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"岗":{"c":"岗","pinyin":"gǎng","lectures":["gǎng","gāng"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["山","冂","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0304","L7-3566","L7-4453"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"poste de garde, poste ; colline","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"poste de garde ; poste de travail"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"colline, butte"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"港":{"c":"港","pinyin":"gǎng","lectures":["gǎng"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["氵","龷","八","巳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0305","L7-1273"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"port ; Hong Kong","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"port"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"Hong Kong : abréviation"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"船已经进港了。","pinyin":"Chuán yǐjīng jìn gǎng le.","fr":"Le bateau est déjà à quai.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"杠":{"c":"杠","pinyin":"gàng","lectures":["gàng","gāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","工"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1274"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"barre, bâton ; trait","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"barre, bâton ; trait"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"糕":{"c":"糕","pinyin":"gāo","lectures":["gāo"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["米","羊","灬"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0180","L5-0961"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"gâteau","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"gâteau"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"糟糕，下雨了！","pinyin":"Zāogāo, xià yǔ le!","fr":"Zut, il pleut !","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"膏":{"c":"膏","pinyin":"gāo","lectures":["gāo","gào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亠","口","冖","口","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4759"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pâte, onguent","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"pâte, onguent, crème"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"高":{"c":"高","pinyin":"gāo","lectures":["gāo"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0115","L1-0116","L2-0184","L2-0185","L2-0528","L3-0224","L3-0225","L3-0711","L4-0264","L4-0265","L4-0266","L4-0267","L4-0630","L5-0264","L5-0265","L5-0266","L5-0267","L5-0268","L5-0269","L5-0672","L6-0306","L6-0307","L6-0308","L6-0309","L6-0310","L6-0311","L6-0312","L7-0506","L7-1275","L7-1276","L7-1277","L7-1278","L7-1279","L7-1280","L7-1281","L7-1282","L7-1283","L7-1284","L7-1285","L7-1286","L7-1287","L7-1288","L7-1289","L7-1290","L7-1291","L7-1292","L7-1293","L7-1698","L7-2265","L7-3868","L7-4650"],"chemin":{"hsk":42,"lire":42},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"haut, grand","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他很高。","pinyin":"Tā hěn gāo.","fr":"Il est très grand.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"这个楼很高。","pinyin":"Zhège lóu hěn gāo.","fr":"Cet immeuble est très haut.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 高 dessine un bâtiment élevé : un toit en pointe, un étage, puis une base percée d'une ouverture. Le Shuowen jiezi y lit la forme d'une tour ou d'une terrasse haute, et le sens « haut » vient de là. Le caractère moderne garde cet empilement : le toit 亠, un premier 口, puis un cadre qui contient un second 口.","en":"On oracle bones, 高 draws a tall building: a pointed roof, an upper storey, then a base with an opening. The Shuowen jiezi reads it as a tower or a raised terrace, and the meaning “high” comes from that. The modern character keeps the stack: the roof 亠, a first 口, then a frame holding a second 口.","roles":{}}},"搞":{"c":"搞","pinyin":"gǎo","lectures":["gǎo"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","高"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0270","L5-0271","L7-1294","L7-1295"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire, s'occuper de ; se procurer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"faire, s'occuper de (oral)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"se procurer, obtenir"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你在搞什么？","pinyin":"Nǐ zài gǎo shénme?","fr":"Qu'est-ce que tu fabriques ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"稿":{"c":"稿","pinyin":"gǎo","lectures":["gǎo"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","高"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0313","L7-4158"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"brouillon, manuscrit","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"brouillon, manuscrit ; texte"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"告":{"c":"告","pinyin":"gào","lectures":["gào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["𠂒","口"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0117","L2-0205","L3-0027","L3-0226","L4-0977","L5-0281","L5-0411","L6-0028","L6-1007","L7-1296","L7-1297","L7-1298","L7-1299","L7-1300","L7-1301","L7-2420","L7-3404","L7-4119","L7-4368","L7-4705","L7-5112"],"chemin":{"hsk":16},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"annoncer, informer ; accuser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"annoncer, informer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"accuser, porter plainte contre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我要去告他。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào qù gào tā.","fr":"Je vais porter plainte contre lui.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"割":{"c":"割","pinyin":"gē","lectures":["gē"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["宀","丰","口","刂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1118","L7-1308","L7-3301","L7-3459"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"couper, faucher","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"couper, faucher"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"农民在地里割麦子。","pinyin":"Nóngmín zài dì li gē màizi.","fr":"Les paysans moissonnent le blé dans les champs.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"哥":{"c":"哥","pinyin":"gē","lectures":["gē"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丁","口","丁","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0118","L4-0144","L4-0675"],"chemin":{"hsk":127,"lire":109},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"grand frère","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 哥 par « voix », le décrit comme deux 可 superposés et note qu'il servait à écrire « chanter ». Le sens de « grand frère » est venu plus tard, par emprunt, et le chant s'écrit aujourd'hui 歌. 可 (kě) en donnait le son, qui ne sonne plus aujourd'hui comme gē.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 哥 as “voice”, describes it as two 可 stacked, and notes that it was used to write “to sing”. The meaning “elder brother” came later, by borrowing, and singing is now written 歌. 可 (kě) once gave the sound, which no longer sounds like gē today.","roles":{}}},"戈":{"c":"戈","pinyin":"gē","lectures":["gē"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L7-1248","L7-1302"],"chemin":{"hsk":147,"lire":130},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"hallebarde (arme ancienne)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 戈 dessine la hallebarde de l'âge du bronze : une lame posée en travers d'un long manche. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit comme une lance à tête plate. On le retrouve dans 我, qui dessinait une arme à lame dentelée, et dans 成, puis 城.","en":"On oracle bones, 戈 draws the dagger-axe of the Bronze Age: a blade set crosswise on a long shaft. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as a flat-headed halberd. It turns up in 我, which once drew a weapon with a serrated blade, and in 成, and so in 城.","roles":{}}},"搁":{"c":"搁","pinyin":"gē","lectures":["gē","gé"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","门","夂","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0743","L7-1305","L7-1306","L7-1307"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"poser, mettre ; laisser de côté","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"poser, mettre"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"laisser de côté, remettre à plus tard"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"把书搁在桌子上吧。","pinyin":"Bǎ shū gē zài zhuōzi shang ba.","fr":"Laisse les livres sur la table.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"歌":{"c":"歌","pinyin":"gē","lec